            },
            "chunk_type": "insider_holding",
            "content": "On November 6, 2023, Douglas Herrington, CEO Worldwide Amazon Stores, adopted a trading plan intended to satisfy Rule 10b5-1(c) to sell up to 130,162 shares of Amazon.com, Inc. common stock over a period ending on December 31, 2024, subject to certain conditions.",
