            "content": "On November 16, 2023, Andrew Jassy, President and Chief Executive Officer, adopted a trading plan intended to satisfy Rule 10b5-1(c) to sell up to 190,900 shares of Amazon.com, Inc. common stock over a period ending on December 31, 2024, subject to certain conditions.",
